{
  "name": "GHL 5 - Manager Charges or Waives Fee",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GHL 5. Charge or Waive\n\n**In simple words:** the manager taps the fee link (sent by GoHighLevel). The page shows who, when and how much, with **Charge** and **Waive** buttons.\n- **Charge:** Square charges the saved card.\n- **Waive:** nothing is charged.\nThen n8n adds **fee-charged** or **fee-waived** in GoHighLevel (which sends the receipt text and moves the pipeline card) and writes a note on the contact.",
        "width": 660,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b633d044-bdf6-4c83-86e9-202c7a9e9668",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -440
      ]
    },
